# What `git archive` must NOT put into the tree a GPU job runs.
#
# Every job extracts `git archive <branch>` fresh (on this machine, or copied to the
# ssh host). Every path below is read by the LOCAL side only -- the student agent and
# the meta agent read the workspace directory directly, and the driver reads the
# archives -- so shipping them only makes every job copy files it never opens.
#
# Do NOT add `notes/` here: probe rounds are submitted as `python3 notes/<probe>.py`
# and really do run on the node.
#
# Anything an operator card adds that only the local side reads (extra reference
# write-ups, captured profiles, digests) belongs in this list too -- and an edit
# to this file only takes effect once it is COMMITTED to the branch being
# archived: `git archive <tree-ish>` reads attributes from that tree, not from the
# working directory (that would need --worktree-attributes, which the submitter
# deliberately does not pass -- the payload for a given commit stays reproducible).

milestone.md            export-ignore
README.md               export-ignore
window.toml             export-ignore
agent/                  export-ignore
student/                export-ignore
meta_status.jsonl       export-ignore
arch_baseline.json      export-ignore
ref_baseline.json       export-ignore
best_confirmation.json  export-ignore
